---
import PrivateLayout from '../layouts/PrivateLayout.astro';

const modeOptions = [
	{ value: 'time', label: 'Time (duración configurable)' },
	{ value: 'quote', label: 'Quote completa' },
	{ value: 'words', label: 'Words (50 / 100 / 150 en home)' },
	{ value: 'zen', label: 'Zen (escritura libre)' },
	{ value: 'custom', label: 'Custom' }
];

const languageOptions = [
	{ value: 'english', label: 'English' },
	{ value: 'spanish', label: 'Español' }
];

const timeOptions = [
	{ value: 30, label: '30 segundos' },
	{ value: 60, label: '60 segundos' },
	{ value: 120, label: '120 segundos' }
];

const themeOptions = [
	{ value: 'system', label: 'System' },
	{ value: 'dark', label: 'Dark' },
	{ value: 'light', label: 'Light' }
];
---

<PrivateLayout
	title="MonkeyType | Settings"
	description="Configuración privada de MonkeyType conectada a preferencias reales del backend."
	activeHref="/settings"
	pageEyebrow="Settings"
	pageTitle="Ajustá la experiencia hasta que se sienta tuya."
	pageDescription="La estructura visual sigue siendo profunda y ordenada, pero ahora theme, language, defaultMode, timeDuration, live WPM y sound se leen y persisten contra la API real."
>
	<section class="settings-page" data-settings-page>
		<article class="terminal-panel settings-profile">
			<div>
				<span class="eyebrow">Profile</span>
				<h2 data-settings-user-name>—</h2>
				<p data-settings-user-email>—</p>
			</div>
			<div class="settings-profile__actions">
				<button class="button-ghost" data-action="logout" type="button">Cerrar sesión</button>
			</div>
		</article>

		<div class="status-box is-visible" data-settings-status data-tone="info">Cargando preferencias...</div>

		<form class="settings-grid" data-preferences-form>
			<article class="terminal-panel settings-card settings-card--form">
				<div class="settings-card__header">
					<h3>Experience</h3>
					<span>Core</span>
				</div>
				<p>Lo esencial para que la home tipográfica llegue lista: tema, idioma y modo por defecto.</p>
				<div class="settings-fields">
					<label class="settings-field">
						<span>Theme</span>
						<select name="theme">
							{themeOptions.map((option) => (
								<option value={option.value}>{option.label}</option>
							))}
						</select>
					</label>
					<label class="settings-field">
						<span>Language</span>
						<select name="language">
							{languageOptions.map((option) => (
								<option value={option.value}>{option.label}</option>
							))}
						</select>
					</label>
					<label class="settings-field">
						<span>Default mode</span>
						<select name="defaultMode">
							{modeOptions.map((option) => (
								<option value={option.value}>{option.label}</option>
							))}
						</select>
					</label>
					<label class="settings-field">
						<span>Time duration</span>
						<select name="timeDuration">
							{timeOptions.map((option) => (
								<option value={option.value}>{option.label}</option>
							))}
						</select>
					</label>
				</div>
			</article>

			<article class="terminal-panel settings-card settings-card--form">
				<div class="settings-card__header">
					<h3>Live feedback</h3>
					<span>Runtime</span>
				</div>
				<p>Controlá cuánta señal aparece mientras escribís y si querés audio mínimo para error/success.</p>
				<div class="settings-toggles">
					<label class="settings-toggle">
						<div>
							<strong>Show live WPM</strong>
							<p>Muestra u oculta la métrica viva en la pantalla principal.</p>
						</div>
						<input name="showLiveWpm" type="checkbox" />
					</label>
					<label class="settings-toggle">
						<div>
							<strong>Sound enabled</strong>
							<p>Activa tonos sutiles para errores y finalización del test.</p>
						</div>
						<input name="soundEnabled" type="checkbox" />
					</label>
				</div>
			</article>

			<article class="terminal-panel settings-card">
				<div class="settings-card__header">
					<h3>Preview</h3>
					<span>Now</span>
				</div>
				<p data-settings-summary>Theme system • english • time 30s • live WPM on • sound off</p>
				<ul class="settings-bullets">
					<li><span>La home usa language + defaultMode + timeDuration para elegir quote, duración base o armar words 50/100/150.</span></li>
					<li><span>Theme se aplica en caliente sobre el layout actual.</span></li>
					<li><span>Zen guarda stats/resultados, pero no persiste el texto libre como quote en Mongo.</span></li>
					<li><span>Los cambios se guardan con PATCH real a <code>/api/users/me/preferences</code>.</span></li>
				</ul>
			</article>

			<article class="terminal-panel settings-card is-danger">
				<div class="settings-card__header">
					<h3>Danger zone</h3>
					<span>Session</span>
				</div>
				<p>Mantenemos una zona sensible, pero sin humo: podés descartar cambios locales o cerrar sesión del dispositivo actual.</p>
				<div class="settings-actions">
					<button class="button-secondary" data-action="reset-form" type="button">Descartar cambios</button>
					<button class="button-ghost" data-action="logout" type="button">Cerrar sesión</button>
				</div>
			</article>

			<div class="settings-submit">
				<button class="button-primary" data-action="save-preferences" type="submit">Guardar preferencias</button>
			</div>
		</form>
	</section>
</PrivateLayout>

<script>
	import { initSettingsPage } from '../scripts/settings-page';

	initSettingsPage();
</script>

<style>
	.settings-page {
		display: grid;
		gap: 1rem;
	}

	.settings-profile {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 1rem;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 1.4rem 1.6rem;
	}

	.settings-profile h2 {
		margin: 0.8rem 0 0.3rem;
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: 1.8rem;
	}

	.settings-profile p {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	.settings-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 1rem;
		align-items: start;
	}

	.settings-card {
		padding: 1.35rem 1.4rem;
	}

	.settings-card--form {
		min-height: 100%;
	}

	.settings-card__header {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 1rem;
		align-items: baseline;
	}

	.settings-card__header h3 {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: 1.35rem;
	}

	.settings-card__header span {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.16em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--text-dim);
	}

	.settings-card p {
		margin: 0.85rem 0 1rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	.settings-fields,
	.settings-toggles,
	.settings-actions {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.85rem;
	}

	.settings-field {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.45rem;
	}

	.settings-field span,
	.settings-toggle strong {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.76rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.14em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--text-dim);
	}

	.settings-field select {
		min-height: 3rem;
		padding: 0.8rem 0.95rem;
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
		border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
		color: var(--text);
		appearance: none;
		-webkit-appearance: none;
		-moz-appearance: none;
		color-scheme: dark;
	}

	.settings-field select:focus {
		outline: none;
		border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 28%, transparent);
		box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 10%, transparent);
	}

	.settings-field select option {
		background: #1f1f1f;
		color: #f1ebdf;
	}

	.settings-toggle {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 1rem;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 0.95rem 1rem;
		border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
	}

	.settings-toggle p {
		margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
		font-size: 0.92rem;
	}

	.settings-toggle input {
		width: 1.15rem;
		height: 1.15rem;
		accent-color: var(--accent);
	}

	.settings-bullets {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.7rem;
		margin: 0;
		padding-left: 1rem;
		color: var(--text-muted);
	}

	.settings-bullets code {
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		color: var(--accent-strong);
	}

	.settings-actions {
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
	}

	.settings-submit {
		grid-column: 1 / -1;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: flex-end;
	}

	.settings-bullets li {
		padding: 0;
		background: transparent;
		border: 0;
	}

	.settings-card.is-danger {
		border-color: rgba(255, 143, 122, 0.25);
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.settings-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.settings-submit {
			justify-content: stretch;
		}

		.settings-submit button {
			width: 100%;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.settings-profile,
		.settings-card__header,
		.settings-toggle,
		.settings-actions {
			flex-direction: column;
			align-items: stretch;
		}

		.settings-actions {
			display: flex;
		}
	}
</style>
